WEBVTT

00:04:59.079 --> 00:05:01.121
or suffering that they might experience.
Well.

00:05:02.163 --> 00:05:09.621
Actually, we once did a study in which we
we were measuring how people figure,

00:05:09.954 --> 00:05:15.371
how much of the day are people in
different states positive or negative?

00:05:16.704 --> 00:05:23.996
And it turns out that people are
in a positive state on average,

00:05:25.121 --> 00:05:28.579
80 percent of the time, more than
80 percent of the time.

00:05:29.204 --> 00:05:32.746
That is on average, people are
on the positive side of zero.